data: {"id": "72fbf33a10d445e1-thinking-layer-235", "run_id": "72fbf33a10d445e1", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "该 Pod `workload-5f4fb9ff45-5mlnc` 的状态为 `Running` 但 `READY` 为 `0/1`。这符合 **NotReadyProbeFailed** 异常类型，即容器正在运行但探针检查未通过，导致 Pod 未被标记为就绪。\n\n根据异常类型匹配规则，对应 Runbook 为 `pod-notready-probe-failed.md`。我将获取该手册以了解后续诊断步骤。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789093435307}

