data: {"id": "72fbf33a10d445e1-thinking-parallel_evidence-1535", "run_id": "72fbf33a10d445e1", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "我已获取了该 Pod 的关键事实。让我分析这些证据来确认 NotReady 的原因。\n\n## 证据分析\n\n### 1. Pod 状态（kubectl_get_yaml + kubectl_describe）\n- **Phase: Running**，但条件中：\n  - `Ready: status=False, reason=ContainersNotReady, message=containers with unready status: [app]`\n  - `ContainersReady: status=False, reason=ContainersNotReady`\n- **Readiness probe 持续失败**：`Readiness probe failed: HTTP probe failed with statuscode: 503`（已触发 2286 次，持续 110 分钟）\n- 容器 `app`：`ready=False, restarts=0`（无重启，说明容器在运行但探针失败）\n\n### 2. 容器日志（kubectl_logs）\n- 日志显示 **持", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789093517616, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

