pendency unavailable）而持续向客户端和探针返回 **HTTP 503** 错误，触发 K8s Readiness Probe 机制将其判定为不健康（NotReady）。\n\n*   **证据支持**：\n    *   应用代码明确记录了 `dependency unavailable` 错误并在 `/work` 路径返回 503（日志事实 #5、追踪事实 #6）。\n    *   K8s Readiness Probe 因接收到该 503 响应而持续报错（事件事实 #2）。\n    *   容器运行状态正常且无重启（指标事实 #4、状态事实 #1），排除了容器自身的故障。\n    *   该结论由输入 `formal_rca` 明确确认且可发布。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.8m\n├─ 问题定位: 24.1s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 70.8s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-5mlnc: 70.8s (Evidence 64.2s, RCA 6.5s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 13.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-5mlnc**: pod-notready-probe-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 108.186, "metrics": {"run_id": "72fbf33a10d445e1", "mttr": {"value": "1.8m", "seconds": 108.19255185127258, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "51%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-notready-probe-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-notready-probe-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "sco